### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/1

### Search by author
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books?author=martin

### Search by title
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books?title=java

### Create a book
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Head First Java",
  "author": "Kathy Sierra",
  "isbn": "978-0596009205",
  "publishedYear": 2005
}

### Update a book
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code (2nd printing)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0132350884",
  "publishedYear": 2008
}

### Check a book out
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books/1/checkout

### Return a book
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books/1/return

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/books/3

### Error demo: invalid data (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "isbn": ""
}

### Error demo: book not found (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books/999
